1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,129
DamnLens AI Agent converts PDFs and scans into structured Excel. Start with the keyless Local AI workflow.

2
00:00:08,129 --> 00:00:20,262
Upload a digital PDF. The agent detects tables and headers, joins three pages and preserves all 31 rows across 12
columns.

3
00:00:20,262 --> 00:00:28,314
Click an extracted row to open its original source page and highlight the matching location.

4
00:00:28,314 --> 00:00:35,422
Inspect page-by-page coverage and extraction routes. Every invoice row retains source evidence.

5
00:00:35,422 --> 00:00:57,447
The image-only inventory PDF is read with local English OCR. Watch page progress, table reconstruction and
validation complete.

6
00:00:57,447 --> 00:01:05,479
Inspect an OCR row against the scanned source. The two pages produce 20 rows and 12 columns.

7
00:01:05,479 --> 00:01:13,563
Open the standalone PNG result: 10 rows and 12 reconstructed columns, with the original image available beside the
data.

8
00:01:13,563 --> 00:01:25,675
The 50-page document produces 500 rows and 12 columns. Repeated headers are removed; duplicate business rows
are preserved and flagged.

9
00:01:25,675 --> 00:01:32,694
All 50 pages remain individually accessible, with source evidence retained for all 500 rows.

10
00:01:32,694 --> 00:01:39,807
Expand the detected header structure to inspect parent and child labels in a nested line-item table.

11
00:01:39,807 --> 00:01:47,834
Select a shared order ID to inspect the original merged cell. Inherited values retain their source geometry.

12
00:01:47,834 --> 00:01:53,882
A description continues across pages. The reconstructed row keeps links to both original source fragments.

13
00:01:53,882 --> 00:02:04,903
Switch to the second source part to inspect the continued description on page two.

14
00:02:04,903 --> 00:02:13,036
The bank statement includes intentional source errors. The agent preserves the values and flags them for review.

15
00:02:13,036 --> 00:02:21,152
Validation identifies missing fields, running-balance errors and a total that does not reconcile.

16
00:02:21,152 --> 00:02:29,307
Open the total finding to inspect its original row. The stated debit total is 2,600; contributing rows sum to 2,500.

17
00:02:29,307 --> 00:02:36,328
Locate the missing currency field in its source page before making an explicit correction.

18
00:02:36,328 --> 00:02:42,397
Open the cell editor. The original extracted value will remain in the correction history.

19
00:02:42,397 --> 00:02:50,488
For this demonstration, enter USD from the statement context. Validation reruns and the finding count updates from
six to five.

20
00:02:50,488 --> 00:02:57,495
The correction history retains the original blank, the entered value, its location and the time of the edit.

21
00:02:57,495 --> 00:03:03,516
Review confirms source checks and requires acknowledgement of outstanding findings.

22
00:03:03,516 --> 00:03:11,609
Record a review note. The remaining source errors stay visible and are acknowledged for this export.

23
00:03:11,609 --> 00:03:18,657
The Excel export includes structured data, review status, findings, source evidence, corrections, page coverage and
the run log.

24
00:03:18,657 --> 00:03:23,533
Download the reviewed Excel workbook. Outstanding findings remain included in the file.

25
00:03:23,533 --> 00:03:33,534
Optional Gemini assistance adds an independent reading of difficult pages. It requires a configured API key and
explicit authorization.

26
00:03:33,534 --> 00:03:39,557
Set a request limit and page scope. Google API plan and quotas apply; Local AI remains available without a key.

27
00:03:39,557 --> 00:03:49,000
The three bundled sample PDFs have matching Excel outputs and ground truth: 864 matching data cells, with headers
checked separately.
